The evaluation contract dreamteam.benchmark-contract/v1
(docs/BENCHMARK_SUITE.md): the harness's own metrics on six dimensions, each
reported on its own; no composite score, weighting, leaderboard or ranking.
Absent values are marked, not estimated. T90 is reported only where the
evaluation policy in force applies. Paired differences are policy minus
